# Zeta1 Reticuli

id:world-zeta1-reticuli a oa:Place, oa:World ;
    skos:prefLabel "Zeta1 Reticuli" ;
    oa:article <https://www.orionsarm.com/eg-article/486ecd3a8e1a5> ;
    oa:editorialNote "---- the Laughter Hegemony -----------------------------------------------" ;
    oa:kind "system" ;
    oa:labelsSystem false ;
    oa:note "39.3 ly out against the article's 39.53, and the most divided system in this file: five metaempires hold parts of it, with a good deal besides answering to none of them. The ring can show four, so the Zoeific Biopolity is listed last and appears in the panel rather than on the marker. Its companion Zeta2 Reticuli is the Diamond Network's, a third of a light year away." ;
    oa:systemName "Zeta1 Reticuli" ;
    oa:uncertain false .

